  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The African Institute for Development Policy generates and translates policy-relevant research, builds capacity for evidence use, and engages in policy dialogue and advocacy to influence effective decision-making. This grant will enable the organization, through its Women&#x2019;s Economic Empowerment (WEE) and Macroeconomic Policy Program, to continue harnessing its unique position and expertise to stimulate and support the macroeconomic policy ecosystem to transform WEE throughout East and West Africa.</narrative>
  </description>
